  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "kind": "source-based",
      "sourceIds": [
        "ilo-business"
      ],
      "text": "On 2 October 2026, the International Labour Organization reported a new business competition in Ethiopia. It is for refugees and people in the communities where they live. Some want to start a business. Others already have one and want to grow it.",
      "translationJa": "2026年10月2日、国際労働機関はエチオピアで新たな事業コンテストが始まったと発表しました。対象は難民と、難民を受け入れている地域の人々です。これから事業を始めたい人も、すでに営む事業を大きくしたい人も参加対象です。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "kind": "source-based",
      "sourceIds": [
        "ilo-business"
      ],
      "text": "The programme plans to give training to 3,000 people. They will learn how to develop a business idea. Next, 1,500 people will receive more training to make their plans better. After a selection, 450 people will receive money to start or grow their businesses.",
      "translationJa": "このプログラムでは3,000人に研修を提供する予定です。参加者は事業のアイデアを具体化する方法を学びます。次に1,500人が追加の研修を受け、計画をよりよいものにします。その後の選考を経て、450人が事業の開始や拡大に使う資金を受け取る予定です。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "kind": "source-based",
      "sourceIds": [
        "ilo-business"
      ],
      "text": "The support is not only money. Participants can learn about business planning and managing money. They can also get help with the official steps needed to run a business. People who do not receive money may be connected with banks, where possible.",
      "translationJa": "支援は資金だけではありません。参加者は事業計画やお金の管理についても学べます。事業を営むために必要な正式な手続きの支援も受けられます。資金を受け取れなかった人には、可能な場合、銀行への紹介も行われます。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "kind": "source-based",
      "sourceIds": [
        "ilo-business"
      ],
      "text": "These numbers describe the new programme's plans. They do not tell us how many businesses have already opened. The competition brings training and financial support together. Both refugees and local people can take part.",
      "translationJa": "これらの人数は、新しいプログラムの計画を表しています。すでに開業した事業の数を示しているわけではありません。このコンテストは研修と資金面の支援を組み合わせています。難民も地域の人々も参加できます。"
    }
  ],
